# Shared build context for every Dockerfile under .github/docker/ that uses
# the repo root as context (confirmed via `grep -rn context: .github/docker/`
# and the `.github/workflows/*.yml` build steps) — kept deliberately minimal.
# Only excludes things no image build could ever legitimately need from the
# host (editor/VCS/OS metadata), never anything a specific Dockerfile's COPY
# might rely on, since this file is shared across unrelated image builds.

.git
.github/.cache
.claude
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
